# Copy to .env.local and fill in one provider key (or both).
# At least one of ANTHROPIC_API_KEY or OPENAI_API_KEY is required.

# --- Provider selection ---
# Which LLM to use. One of: anthropic | openai | auto
# Default (unset or "auto") prefers Anthropic if its key is set, else OpenAI.
# LLM_PROVIDER=openai

# --- Anthropic (Claude) ---
# Get a key at: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# Optional model override. Defaults to claude-sonnet-4-5.
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5

# --- OpenAI ---
# Get a key at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# Optional model override. Defaults to gpt-4o-2024-08-06.
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-2024-08-06

# --- Site URL ---
# Used by metadataBase for OpenGraph + absolute URLs. Required in production.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-deploy.vercel.app

# --- Optional: Upstash Redis REST credentials for /api/chat rate limiting ---
# (20 requests / hour per IP). Without these the rate limiter no-ops.
# Get free creds at https://console.upstash.com/redis (REST API tab).
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://...upstash.io
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=...
